Z||000000||hugh||05-13-2001||08:10 AM||||Happy mothers day to all you mothers out there(you know who you are).<BR> That was for fun.<BR>This is serious.<BR>My mom died about 16 years ago.I still love and miss her.After my dad died we used to go visit.When we would be leaving she would stand on the back porch and wave,I would give her the finger and she would give it right back.She was a great woman that worked as a vol.at a shop that took donations and sold them to help feed the needy and buy fuel for them in the winter months.She took clothes home that needed repair,fix them and then distributed them herself.She had a regular route that she covered and knew who needed what and the sizes.When she was sick she was nominated by two different organizations for woman of the year.She made me go to the newspaper offices and take her name out of the running.I do believe she is now a saint in heaven,for there can be no one who was a greater person or more deserving of sainthood.   ||||reg||1
